            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"horario-escolar\">Hor\u00e1rio escolar \u23f1\ufe0f</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Para gerar um hor\u00e1rio com base nos dados\nem <code>./dados/</code>, <marimo-ui-element object-id='MJUe-0' random-id='338c2ccb-6c1f-d6ce-e057-3ee5a4175640'><marimo-anywidget data-initial-value='{&quot;model_id&quot;:&quot;a2e7278657754fb88e57e5e5bdbdbe31&quot;}' data-label='null' data-model-id='&quot;a2e7278657754fb88e57e5e5bdbdbe31&quot;'></marimo-anywidget></marimo-ui-element>.</span>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: 1px; background-color: #ccc\" /></span>"
