    {
      "id": "BYtC",
      "code_hash": "dd28048ed20d399ec2b7c90e0efa5600",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><details>\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer\"><code>build_model(data)</code></summary>\n<marimo-ui-element object-id='BYtC-0' random-id='12e25a09-2fd6-1f58-f015-7b5a276fbc96'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;def build_model(data):&#92;n    model = cp_model.CpModel()&#92;n    grades = [grade[&#x27;turma&#x27;] for grade in data[&#x27;turmas&#x27;]]&#92;n    subjects = data[&#x27;disciplinas&#x27;]&#92;n    teachers = dict.fromkeys(subject[&#x27;professor&#x27;] for subject in subjects)&#92;n    unavailable = unavailable_periods(data)&#92;n&#92;n    # x[grade, subject, day, slot] is true when the grade has that subject at that time&#92;n    x = {(grade, subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;], day, slot):&#92;n         model.new_bool_var(f&#92;&quot;{grade}_{subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;]}_{day}_{slot}&#92;&quot;)&#92;n         for grade in grades for subject in subjects for day, slot in TIMES}&#92;n&#92;n    for grade in grades:&#92;n        # R1: no two lectures of the same grade at the same time&#92;n        for day, slot in TIMES:&#92;n            model.add(sum(x[grade, subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;], day, slot] for subject in subjects) &#92;u003c= 1)&#92;n&#92;n        for subject in subjects:&#92;n            name = subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;]&#92;n            # R2: exactly carga_semanal lectures a week&#92;n            model.add(sum(x[grade, name, day, slot] for day, slot in TIMES)&#92;n                      == int(subject[&#x27;carga_semanal&#x27;]))&#92;n&#92;n            for day in range(5):&#92;n                today = [x[grade, name, day, slot] for slot in range(5)]&#92;n                if subject[&#x27;duplo_periodo&#x27;] == &#x27;sim&#x27;:&#92;n                    # R3 and R4: at most one double block a day, so 0 or 2 lectures (never 1)...&#92;n                    model.add(sum(today) &#92;u003c= 2)&#92;n                    model.add(sum(today) != 1)&#92;n                    # R4: ... in consecutive slots: never two slots more than 1 apart&#92;n                    for slot in range(5):&#92;n                        for later in range(slot + 2, 5):&#92;n                            model.add(today[slot] + today[later] &#92;u003c= 1)&#92;n                else:&#92;n                    # R3: at most one lecture of this subject a day&#92;n                    model.add(sum(today) &#92;u003c= 1)&#92;n&#92;n                # R6: no lectures when the teacher is unavailable&#92;n                for slot in range(5):&#92;n                    if (subject[&#x27;professor&#x27;], day, slot) in unavailable:&#92;n                        model.add(today[slot] == 0)&#92;n    # R8: all of the above comes from `data`, read from the CSV files&#92;n&#92;n    # the lectures `teacher` gives at (day, slot), over all grades: 0 or 1 because of R5&#92;n    def teaching(teacher, day, slot):&#92;n        return sum(x[grade, subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;], day, slot]&#92;n                   for grade in grades for subject in subjects&#92;n                   if subject[&#x27;professor&#x27;] == teacher)&#92;n&#92;n    # R5: a teacher gives at most one lecture at a time, over all grades&#92;n    for teacher in teachers:&#92;n        for day, slot in TIMES:&#92;n            model.add(teaching(teacher, day, slot) &#92;u003c= 1)&#92;n&#92;n    # R7: at any time, never more lectures in a type of room than rooms of that type&#92;n    for room in data[&#x27;salas&#x27;]:&#92;n        for day, slot in TIMES:&#92;n            model.add(sum(x[grade, subject[&#x27;disciplina&#x27;], day, slot]&#92;n                          for grade in grades for subject in subjects if uses(subject, room))&#92;n                      &#92;u003c= int(room[&#x27;quantidade&#x27;]))&#92;n&#92;n    # O1: a slot is a hole when the teacher teaches before and after it that day, but not in it&#92;n    holes = []&#92;n    for teacher in teachers:&#92;n        for day in range(5):&#92;n            busy = [teaching(teacher, day, slot) for slot in range(5)]&#92;n            for slot in range(1, 4):&#92;n                hole = model.new_bool_var(f&#x27;hole_{teacher}_{day}_{slot}&#x27;)&#92;n                for before in range(slot):&#92;n                    for after in range(slot + 1, 5):&#92;n                        model.add(hole &#92;u003e= busy[before] + busy[after] - busy[slot] - 1)&#92;n                holes.append(hole)&#92;n&#92;n    return model, x, holes&#92;n&quot;' data-label='null' data-language='&quot;python&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='true' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>\n</details>\n\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Os dados de \ud83d\udcc1 <code>dados/</code> s\u00e3o lidos e validados por <code>assert_data</code>.\nO modelo tem uma vari\u00e1vel booleana <code>x[turma, disciplina, dia, tempo]</code>,\nverdadeira quando a turma tem essa disciplina nesse tempo. <br />\nPara cada turma, h\u00e1 no m\u00e1ximo uma aula em cada tempo (R1) e, para cada disciplina,\na carga semanal \u00e9 exata (R2), h\u00e1 no m\u00e1ximo uma aula por dia (R3) ou, em duplo per\u00edodo,\n0 ou 2 tempos seguidos (R4), e nenhuma aula quando o professor est\u00e1 indispon\u00edvel (R6). <br />\nDepois, olhando para todas as turmas juntas, um professor d\u00e1 no m\u00e1ximo uma aula de cada\nvez (R5) e, em cada tempo, nenhum tipo de sala tem mais aulas do que salas (R7).\nO solver minimiza os buracos nos hor\u00e1rios dos professores (O1). <br />\nPor fim, cada aula recebe a sua sala: a <code>sala_especial</code> da disciplina ou,\nse estiver vazia, a sala normal.</span></span><style>\n        .timetables {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 30rem), 1fr));\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n            hyphens: auto;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n        }\n        .timetables table {\n            width: 100%;\n            table-layout: fixed;\n            border-collapse: separate;\n            border-spacing: 3px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n        .timetables caption {\n            text-align: left;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 0 3px 0.25rem;\n        }\n        .timetables th {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n        }\n        .timetables tr > th:first-child {\n            width: 2.25rem;\n            padding: 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .timetables td {\n            height: 2.5rem;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 4%, transparent);\n        }\n        .timetables td:not(:empty) {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            background: oklch(0.7 0.14 var(--hue) / 0.2);\n            box-shadow: inset 3px 0 oklch(0.65 0.15 var(--hue));\n        }\n        .timetables td.changed {\n            outline: 2px dashed oklch(0.6 0.15 var(--hue));\n            outline-offset: -2px;\n        }\n        .timetables small {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            opacity: 0.7;\n        }\n    </style><div class=\"timetables\" lang=\"pt\"><table><caption>Turma 7\u00baA</caption><tr><th></th><th>Seg</th><th>Ter</th><th>Qua</th><th>Qui</th><th>Sex</th></tr><tr><th>1\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>2\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td></tr><tr><th>3\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>4\u00ba</th><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th>5\u00ba</th><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr></table><table><caption>Turma 7\u00baB</caption><tr><th></th><th>Seg</th><th>Ter</th><th>Qua</th><th>Qui</th><th>Sex</th></tr><tr><th>1\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>2\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>3\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td></tr><tr><th>4\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th>5\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr></table></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>0</strong> buracos nos hor\u00e1rios dos professores, encontrado em 0.03 s.</span></span></div>"
          }
