    {
      "id": "RGSE",
      "code_hash": "4f5a3e2263eb201a77cbb2fea38c49a4",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"construcao-incremental-r9\">Constru\u00e7\u00e3o incremental (R9)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">H1 \u00e9 gerado para \ud83d\udcc1 <code>dados_v2/</code> com o mesmo modelo, mas a partir de H0:</span>\n<ol>\n<li>H0 \u00e9 dado ao solver como <em>hint</em>, isto \u00e9, como ponto de partida da procura.</li>\n<li>Em vez de minimizar os buracos (O1), o solver maximiza o n\u00famero de aulas de H0 que\n   ficam no mesmo tempo (a sala depende s\u00f3 da disciplina, por isso tamb\u00e9m se mant\u00e9m).</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Como s\u00f3 os dados mudam, o mesmo processo serve para qualquer altera\u00e7\u00e3o: um professor\nindispon\u00edvel (ou dispon\u00edvel) em mais tempos, uma sala avariada, uma turma nova, um\nprofessor substitu\u00eddo.</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Tempo</th>\n<th>Aulas de H0 alteradas (tempo ou sala)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Incremental, a partir de H0</td>\n<td>0.014 s</td>\n<td>1 de 34</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Do zero, sem H0</td>\n<td>0.024 s</td>\n<td>31 de 34</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">H1 incremental, com as aulas que mudaram em rela\u00e7\u00e3o a H0 a tracejado:</span></span><style>\n        .timetables {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 30rem), 1fr));\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n            hyphens: auto;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n        }\n        .timetables table {\n            width: 100%;\n            table-layout: fixed;\n            border-collapse: separate;\n            border-spacing: 3px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n        .timetables caption {\n            text-align: left;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 0 3px 0.25rem;\n        }\n        .timetables th {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n        }\n        .timetables tr > th:first-child {\n            width: 2.25rem;\n            padding: 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .timetables td {\n            height: 2.5rem;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 4%, transparent);\n        }\n        .timetables td:not(:empty) {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            background: oklch(0.7 0.14 var(--hue) / 0.2);\n            box-shadow: inset 3px 0 oklch(0.65 0.15 var(--hue));\n        }\n        .timetables td.changed {\n            outline: 2px dashed oklch(0.6 0.15 var(--hue));\n            outline-offset: -2px;\n        }\n        .timetables small {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            opacity: 0.7;\n        }\n    </style><div class=\"timetables\" lang=\"pt\"><table><caption>Turma 7\u00baA</caption><tr><th></th><th>Seg</th><th>Ter</th><th>Qua</th><th>Qui</th><th>Sex</th></tr><tr><th>1\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>2\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 240\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td></tr><tr><th>3\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\" class=\"changed\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th>4\u00ba</th><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th>5\u00ba</th><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td></tr></table><table><caption>Turma 7\u00baB</caption><tr><th></th><th>Seg</th><th>Ter</th><th>Qua</th><th>Qui</th><th>Sex</th></tr><tr><th>1\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>2\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>3\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 120\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td></tr><tr><th>4\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 300\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 60\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 180\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th