          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"verificacao-dos-requisitos\">Verifica\u00e7\u00e3o dos requisitos</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>check_requirements</code> verifica cada hor\u00e1rio diretamente, sem usar o modelo:\nrel\u00ea os CSV e confirma R1\u2013R7 aula a aula (O1 \u00e9 recontado da mesma forma).\n<code>dados_teste/</code> \u00e9 um conjunto de dados diferente (3 turmas, mais uma disciplina\nde duplo per\u00edodo e a Prof. Diana indispon\u00edvel \u00e0s quartas): o mesmo c\u00f3digo gera um hor\u00e1rio\nv\u00e1lido para ele, porque nada dos dados est\u00e1 no c\u00f3digo (R8).</span></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Requisito</th>\n<th>H0 \u00b7 <code>dados/</code></th>\n<th>H1 incremental \u00b7 <code>dados_v2/</code></th>\n<th>H1 do zero \u00b7 <code>dados_v2/</code></th>\n<th>Teste \u00b7 <code>dados_teste/</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R1</strong> uma aula de cada vez por turma</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R2</strong> carga semanal exata</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R3</strong> no m\u00e1ximo uma aula por dia de cada disciplina</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R4</strong> duplo per\u00edodo em blocos de 2 tempos</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R5</strong> um professor numa aula de cada vez</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R6</strong> disponibilidade dos professores</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R7</strong> salas do tipo certo, sem exceder a quantidade</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n<td>\u2705</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>R8</strong> dados lidos dos CSV de</td>\n<td>\ud83d\udcc1 <code>dados/</code></td>\n<td>\ud83d\udcc1 <code>dados_v2/</code></td>\n<td>\ud83d\udcc1 <code>dados_v2/</code></td>\n<td>\ud83d\udcc1 <code>dados_teste/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>O1</strong> buracos (recontados)</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span><marimo-accordion data-labels='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eHor\u00e1rio gerado para dados_teste/&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-multiple='false' data-expanded='[]'><div><style>\n        .timetables {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 30rem), 1fr));\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n            hyphens: auto;\n            overflow-wrap: break-word;\n        }\n        .timetables table {\n            width: 100%;\n            table-layout: fixed;\n            border-collapse: separate;\n            border-spacing: 3px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n        .timetables caption {\n            text-align: left;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 0 3px 0.25rem;\n        }\n        .timetables th {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n        }\n        .timetables tr > th:first-child {\n            width: 2.25rem;\n            padding: 0;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .timetables td {\n            height: 2.5rem;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 4%, transparent);\n        }\n        .timetables td:not(:empty) {\n            font-weight: 500;\n            background: oklch(0.7 0.14 var(--hue) / 0.2);\n            box-shadow: inset 3px 0 oklch(0.65 0.15 var(--hue));\n        }\n        .timetables td.changed {\n            outline: 2px dashed oklch(0.6 0.15 var(--hue));\n            outline-offset: -2px;\n        }\n        .timetables small {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 400;\n            opacity: 0.7;\n        }\n    </style><div class=\"timetables\" lang=\"pt\"><table><caption>Turma 7\u00baA</caption><tr><th></th><th>Seg</th><th>Ter</th><th>Qua</th><th>Qui</th><th>Sex</th></tr><tr><th>1\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 154\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 205\">Ingl\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 102\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 51\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th>2\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 308\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o Visual<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 51\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 51\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 154\">Hist\u00f3ria<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th>3\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 308\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o Visual<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 51\">Portugu\u00eas<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td></tr><tr><th>4\u00ba</th><td style=\"--hue: 102\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Laborat\u00f3rio</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 0\">Matem\u00e1tica<small>Sala Normal</small></td><td style=\"--hue: 257\">Educa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00edsica<small>Gin\u00e1sio</small></td><td></td><td style=\"--hue: 102\">Ci\u00eancias<small>Labo